# Deploy on every change

When you modify this project, always finish with:

1. Commit changes
2. `git push` to GitHub (`origin`)
3. `vercel --prod --yes` for production deploy (or confirm GitHub→Vercel auto-deploy succeeded)

Do not leave local-only changes. Expo Go is not used.
